  Text: "The cargo door is locked and won't budge, these things are not operated
    manually anyway.\n\nYet for some reason, the door's a slightly lifted... and
    <link>fluorescent green goo</link> is spilling out all over <link>Road 54</link>.\n\nWe
    need a way to unlock this thing and see what we're dealing with.  \n\nMaybe the
    driver could help us?"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already tried that, remember?


    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
